    "name": "iM1A2 Abrams",
    "steam_appid": 2577380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the most advanced main battle tank in the world\u2014on the front lines of 21st-century warfare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The classic iM1A2 Abrams</i> delivers a highly detailed, immersive, and tactical simulation of modern armored combat. Developed by Imagic, this groundbreaking title puts you in the command seat of the legendary M1A2 Abrams Main Battle Tank\u2014along with full control of up to three additional armored vehicles as you execute coordinated battlefield operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll operate in hostile combat zones across real-world-inspired conflict zones such as Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia. As a tank commander, you must master both firepower and battlefield strategy. Seamlessly switch between tank crew positions\u2014including driver, gunner, and commander\u2014or issue tactical orders to your platoon and supporting units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full M1A2 Simulation</strong> \u2013 Engage with a realistic fire control system, thermal imaging, and modern tank optics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew Station Switching</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of driver, gunner, or commander positions\u2014or leave it to the AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Command Interface</strong> \u2013 Issue orders to your entire tank platoon and supporting infantry or helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Campaign Theatres</strong> \u2013 Fight across varied combat zones in Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Mission Design</strong> \u2013 Engage in scripted and semi-random missions with variable objectives and AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Enemy AI</strong> \u2013 Opponents utilise real-world tactics, attempting to flank, ambush, or call for support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Accuracy</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Detailed modelling of U.S. and enemy armour, terrain, and weapon systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Environments</strong> \u2013 Use your cannon and machine gun to level obstacles, structures, and enemy armor.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the most advanced main battle tank in the world\u2014on the front lines of 21st-century warfare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The classic iM1A2 Abrams</i> delivers a highly detailed, immersive, and tactical simulation of modern armored combat. Developed by Imagic, this groundbreaking title puts you in the command seat of the legendary M1A2 Abrams Main Battle Tank\u2014along with full control of up to three additional armored vehicles as you execute coordinated battlefield operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll operate in hostile combat zones across real-world-inspired conflict zones such as Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia. As a tank commander, you must master both firepower and battlefield strategy. Seamlessly switch between tank crew positions\u2014including driver, gunner, and commander\u2014or issue tactical orders to your platoon and supporting units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full M1A2 Simulation</strong> \u2013 Engage with a realistic fire control system, thermal imaging, and modern tank optics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew Station Switching</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of driver, gunner, or commander positions\u2014or leave it to the AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Command Interface</strong> \u2013 Issue orders to your entire tank platoon and supporting infantry or helicopters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Campaign Theatres</strong> \u2013 Fight across varied combat zones in Eastern Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Mission Design</strong> \u2013 Engage in scripted and semi-random missions with variable objectives and AI behavior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Enemy AI</strong> \u2013 Opponents utilise real-world tactics, attempting to flank, ambush, or call for support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Accuracy</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Detailed modelling of U.S. and enemy armour, terrain, and weapon systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Environments</strong> \u2013 Use your cannon and machine gun to level obstacles, structures, and enemy armor.</p></li></ul>",
